title Cassette: a card with a Mic boost: the MIC BOOST stepper takes CARD's slot on the recorder (value Off / +10 / +20 / +30 dB), - steps it down
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO recording
env CASSETTE_DEMO_BOOST 1
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 500
expect text "MIC BOOST"
expect notext "CARD"
expect text "SOFT"
expect text "+20 dB"
shot boost-slot
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
@480x320 tapxy 0.0793 0.7147
@640x480 tapxy 0.0793 0.7077
@320x480 tapxy 0.119 0.781
wait 300
expect text "+10 dB"
say the boost - button called card_gain -1: +20 dB became +10 dB
shot boost-down
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
